                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's a fun throwback to early-2000s action-adventure games and does a great job capturing the movie's globetrotting feel. Using the whip to disarm enemies and getting into fights in places like the Prague Opera House are definitely highlights. Unfortunately, the PC controls and platforming haven't aged very well. You'll probably spend just as much time struggling with the camera and awkward jumps as you will fighting enemies.",
